%% draw-visual:
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant P0 as CLI
  participant P1 as agent-plane
  participant P2 as PostgreSQL
  participant P3 as Host files
  participant P4 as Firecracker
  participant P5 as vmagent
  P0->>P1: snapshot a
  P1->>P2: reserve snapshot
  P1->>P5: drain: close mutation admission
  Note over P5: finish running work
  P5->>P1: drained
  Note over P1: collect final results
  P1->>P4: pause, capture memory + devices
  P4->>P3: artifacts
  P1->>P3: copy matching disk to staging
  P1->>P3: publish complete snapshot
  P1->>P2: s1 published
  P1->>P4: terminate machine
  P4->>P1: exit confirmed
  P1->>P2: a stopped
  P1->>P0: s1 done
